  "prefLabel": "Fis 1104.05 Fishing Tournament Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1104.05 Fishing Tournament Permit.\n\n(a) Effective January 1, 2026, an applicant for a fishing tournament shall complete the on-line form “Application for Permit to Conduct a Fishing Tournament”, Rev. 01/26, available at https://www.wildlife.nh.gov/fishing-new-hampshire/tournaments, and submit the required fee, in accordance with Fis 1110.05. If payment of the fee is not received within 10 days of the date of the notice of approval, the application(s) shall be denied for non-payment.\n\n(b) An applicant for a kids’ derby shall complete the on-line form “Application to Conduct a Kids Fishing Derby”, Rev. 01/26, available at https://www.wildlife.nh.gov/fishing-new-hampshire/tournaments.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 1100) #8183, eff 9-28-04 (formerly Fis 1103.01); ss by #9800-B, eff 1-1-11; ss by #10541, eff 4-1-14; amd by #10981, eff 1-1-16; ss by #12768, eff 5-3-19; ss by #12933, eff 11-28-19; ss by #13798, eff 11-1-23; ss by #12768, eff 5-3-19; ss by #14445, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES: 1-2-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1100.html"
